{%- comment -%} WARCAT page.reviews — content inlined so it renders/saves independent of section registration {%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} main-page {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap pagehead__in"><span class="eyebrow">Reviews</span><h1 class="h-lg">{{ page.title }}</h1></div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    {{ page.content }}
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} review-wall {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section" id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap wrap-wide">
    <div class="rev-top">
      <div class="rev-score">
        <div class="big tnum">4.8</div>
        <div><div class="stars" style="--p:96%"></div><p class="muted">Based on 12,418 verified reviews</p></div>
      </div></div>
    <div class="reviews-grid"><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"I genuinely forget the litter box exists now. It's silent — runs while I'm on calls and I never notice."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">JM</span><div><b>Jordan M.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 2 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"The app told me my older cat's weight was dropping before I'd noticed. Vet caught a thyroid issue early."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">PR</span><div><b>Priya R.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 3 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"We have a Maine Coon and most auto boxes are too small. The 90L globe fits him easily."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">DK</span><div><b>Derek K.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 1 cat</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:90%"></span>
          <p>"Took my nervous rescue about a week to trust it. Now she waits by it. The quiet motor is the real deal."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">AL</span><div><b>Amara L.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 2 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"Setup was 10 minutes. Best money I've spent on my cats, full stop."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">TT</span><div><b>Theo T.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 4 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"Three cats, one box, keeps up easily. Zero smell in a small apartment."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">NS</span><div><b>Nadia S.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 3 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:90%"></span>
          <p>"Pricey, but I did the math on litter and time and it's worth it. Multi-cat tracking is shockingly accurate."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">MB</span><div><b>Marcus B.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 2 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"Bought the duo for a two-floor house. Both boxes report into one app. Feels like the future."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">EC</span><div><b>Elena C.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 3 cats</span></div></div>
        </div><div class="rcard" >
          <span class="stars" style="--p:100%"></span>
          <p>"I travel for work and used to dread the litter situation. Now it's handled. Life-changing."</p>
          <div class="rcard__who"><span class="avatar">RF</span><div><b>Riya F.</b><span><span class="verified">✓ Verified</span> · 1 cat</span></div></div>
        </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

